from __future__ import annotations

__doc__ = """
Julia code generation for Phoenix libraries.

This backend supports two related modes:

- pure Julia mode, which lowers instruction trees directly to Julia source,
- wrapper mode, where a selected compiled backend is generated first and a
  Julia module wraps the resulting shared-library entry points via ``ccall``.

Wrapper mode currently supports C and Fortran90 backends. The Julia wrapper
generates the shared-library build command itself and contributes the same
artifact target to the makefile layer so the generated module and build system
stay aligned.
"""

